module fixture.closure.rustc_phantom_marker_non_applied_probe

// THE MEANING-LEVEL RED ARM. It is the specimen `gunbc.recurring_failure_mode`
// `accepted_source_emits_uncompilable_target` files as its FIRST instance -- a coproduct's UNIT
// VARIANT standing in a NON-APPLIED type position -- committed here as a runnable file, which is
// the thing that row records it never had (its own specimen was produced by a lane whose fixture
// was never committed to this repository).
//
// gunbc ACCEPTS this source with zero blocking diagnostics. `Time` is an arm of `Quantity`, not a
// type, so the emitted field annotation names a variant where rustc requires a type and the only
// wall that fires belongs to the target's compiler. DESIGN section 7 makes that the seed's floor
// and not the target's problem, and DESIGN section 5 makes it silent wrongness on the
// source-to-target path -- below the ladder, not a rung on it.
//
// WHY IT IS NOT IN THE RULED POSITION, WHICH IS THE DISCRIMINATION. `Time` here is a field type,
// never an argument of an applied type node, so `rust_type_arg_identity_spelling` correctly
// declines it and no zero-sized marker is minted for it. That is what makes the pair informative:
// the green arm beside it uses the SAME variant of the SAME coproduct in the ruled position and
// compiles. The single variable across the two arms is the POSITION the identity stands in.
//
// THE ERROR CLASS IS PART OF THE CLAIM, AND IT IS MEASURED. Run through the fixture-closure route
// against the emitter that ships today, rustc refuses the emitted module with E0308 at the parent
// boundary -- `expected Quantity, found Time` on the `-> Quantity` return -- because the emitted
// module carries BOTH a `Time` type and a `Quantity::Time` variant, and the field annotation binds
// the first while the declared return wants the second. The E0573 that the phantom-marker witness
// attributes to the positional classifier -- expected type, found variant -- was PREDICTED for this
// fixture and NOT observed; one construction does not settle whether that sentence is stale or
// describes a construction this file does not reach, and it is recorded rather than quietly
// dropped. The adjudicated expectation lives in
// `v1_compiler.emitted_closure_compile_host` FIXTURE_PHANTOM_MARKER_RED_EXPECTED_RUSTC_CODE.
//
// WHEN THE WALL CLIMBS -- type-position resolution consulting the TYPE namespace alone and
// refusing a name that resolves to a constructor -- THIS ARM FLIPS TO `SourceRefused` AND MUST BE
// KEPT (DESIGN 4b(4)). What changes then is this pair's expectation, not the fixture's existence.
type Quantity = Time | Memory

type NonApplied {
  value: Time
}

fn non_applied_field_as_quantity(subject: NonApplied) -> Quantity {
  subject.value
}
